{
  "env": {
    "AGENT_TRACING_ENABLED": "true",
    "CC_LANGFUSE_DEBUG": "true",
    "LANGFUSE_BASE_URL": "http://10.64.193.238:3000",
    "LANGFUSE_HOST": "http://localhost:3000",
    "LANGFUSE_USER_ID": "badaniya",
    "TRACE_TO_LANGFUSE": "true",
    "LANGFUSE_PUBLIC_KEY": "pk-lf-bc2136b9-fc1c-4c73-8d1c-3168c121bfc2",
    "LANGFUSE_SECRET_KEY": "sk-lf-63433fdb-0939-43b2-b36e-216fb7092c96"
  },
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Read(/home/**)",
      "Bash(tmux send-keys -t teleport-console *)"
    ],
    "defaultMode": "auto"
  },
  "model": "sonnet",
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "\"/home/badaniya/.claude/hooks/context-mode-cache-heal.mjs\""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash '/home/badaniya/.claude/hooks/herdr-agent-state.sh' session",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "startup",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "~/.claude/hooks/cbm-session-reminder"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "resume",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "~/.claude/hooks/cbm-session-reminder"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "clear",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "~/.claude/hooks/cbm-session-reminder"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "compact",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "~/.claude/hooks/cbm-session-reminder"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "python3 ~/.claude/hooks/agent_tracing_hook.py"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Grep|Glob",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "~/.claude/hooks/cbm-code-discovery-gate",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SubagentStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "~/.claude/hooks/cbm-subagent-reminder"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "statusLine": {
    "type": "command",
    "command": "bash ~/.claude/statusline-command.sh"
  },
  "enabledPlugins": {
    "code-review@claude-plugins-official": false,
    "code-simplifier@claude-plugins-official": false,
    "context-mode@context-mode": true,
    "frontend-design@claude-plugins-official": false,
    "gopls-lsp@claude-plugins-official": true,
    "langfuse-observability@claude-plugins-official": true,
    "superpowers@claude-plugins-official": true,
    "chrome-devtools-mcp@chrome-devtools-plugins": true,
    "github@claude-plugins-official": false
  },
  "extraKnownMarketplaces": {
    "context-mode": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "mksglu/context-mode"
      }
    },
    "langfuse-observability": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "langfuse/Claude-Observability-Plugin"
      }
    },
    "chrome-devtools-plugins": {
      "source": {
        "source": "github",
        "repo": "ChromeDevTools/chrome-devtools-mcp"
      }
    }
  },
  "outputStyle": "Concise",
  "effortLevel": "medium",
  "autoCompactWindow": 500000,
  "skipDangerousModePermissionPrompt": true,
  "theme": "dark",
  "skipAutoPermissionPrompt": true,
  "autoMode": {
    "allow": [
      "$defaults",
      "Bash(herdr:*) — routine non-standard CLI, 145× in-project and 35× in shell history, no denial evidence"
    ],
    "soft_deny": [
      "$defaults",
      "Bash(*prod/Dockerfile*) — writes under scripts/golang/prod/ treated as production-adjacent IaC/deploy surface",
      "Bash(cat Common/etc/database/decrypt_credentials.sh) and similar reads of decrypt_credentials.sh — sensitive credential-handling script"
    ],
    "environment": [
      "### Org-wide",
      "**Organization**: Extreme Networks (github.extremenetworks.com — GHE host)",
      "**Cloud provider(s)**: None configured",
      "**Repository visibility**: assume private (GHE host github.extremenetworks.com; not queryable via gh from here)",
      "**Internal sharing / snippet hosting**: None configured — treat public paste/gist services as outside the trust boundary",
      "**Secrets management**: None configured",
      "**Default / protected branches**: Default branch `campus_fabric` (repo_facts); protected-branch status not queryable here — treat as protected pending confirmation",
      "**CI/CD deploy targets**: None configured",
      "**Network posture**: None configured",
      "**Host containment**: None configured — assume Claude Code runs on an ordinary developer machine with open internet",
      "**Source control**: origin — https://github.extremenetworks.com/Engineering/GoDCApp (this repo's remote only)",
      "**Trusted internal domains**: nhweb.labs.extremenetworks.com (repo working host, contacted 7×)",
      "**Trusted cloud buckets**: None configured",
      "**Key internal services**: nexus-aws.aerohive.com (package registry host, config scan)",
      "**Internal package registry**: nexus-aws.aerohive.com",
      "**Sensitive data locations & audiences**: Common/etc/database/decrypt_credentials.sh, Common/etc/rbac/permissions.yaml, scripts/redis/users_acl_rbac.conf, scripts/redis/Dockerfile.rbac, scripts/golang/prod/Dockerfile, scripts/golang/prod/README.md, scripts/deploy/helm/* — share only with audiences cleared at the [named+specifics] bar",
      "**Data retention / declassification**: None configured",
      "**Sensitive remote targets**: scripts/golang/prod/Dockerfile, scripts/golang/prod/README.md, and any namespace/host/container with `prod` or `production` as a whole name segment",
      "**Protected deployment namespaces / environments**: None configured — fall back to the Sensitive remote targets heuristic",
      "**Protected IaC scopes**: Common/etc/rbac/permissions.yaml, scripts/redis/users_acl_rbac.conf, scripts/redis/Dockerfile.rbac, scripts/jenkins-pipelines/util/helm_install.sh, scripts/jenkins-pipelines/util/helm_update.sh, scripts/deploy/helm/* — plus any IAM/RBAC/networking/quota/node-pool resource carrying `prod`/`production` as a whole name segment",
      "### User-specific",
      "**Primary use of Claude Code**: software development (GoDCApp/NVO — Network Virtualization Overlay service, Go-based, per README/build structure)",
      "**Trusted repo**: /home/badaniya/workspace/badaniya/NVO-REVIEW/GoDCApp/NVO and its origin remote https://github.extremenetworks.com/Engineering/GoDCApp",
      "**Org-specific CLIs**: herdr (145× in-project, 35× shell history), tsh (130× shell history), pi (138× shell history), tkl (19× shell history) — routine under this project's working context",
      "routine under Common/, Network/, Edge/, Scheduler/, uinvo/, scripts/jenkins-pipelines/ prefixes (this repo's own module layout)"
    ]
  }
}
